  "ruleText": "Adm 1002.01 \"Appointed counsel\" means defense counsel appointed to represent a defendant at the expense of the State of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 1000) #8697, eff 8-3-06; ss by #9149, eff 5-1-08; ss by #10728, eff 11-25-14; ss by #13050, eff 7-1-20",
